#: dselect/install:33
msgid "Bad default setting!"
msgstr "Marrit paramètre per defaut !"

#: dselect/install:52 dselect/install:84 dselect/install:88 dselect/install:95
#: dselect/install:106 dselect/update:45
msgid "Press [Enter] to continue."
msgstr "Quichatz [Entrada] per contunhar."

#: dselect/install:92
msgid "Do you want to erase any previously downloaded .deb files?"
msgstr ""
"Volètz suprimir qual fichièr .deb que siá precedentament telecargats ?"

#: dselect/install:102
msgid "Some errors occurred while unpacking. Packages that were installed"
msgstr ""
"D’unas errors se son produchas pendent la descompression. Los paquets son "
"pas estats installats"

#: dselect/install:103
msgid "will be configured. This may result in duplicate errors"
msgstr "seràn configurats. Pòt menar a d’errors en doble"

#: dselect/install:104
msgid "or errors caused by missing dependencies. This is OK, only the errors"
msgstr ""
"o d’errors provocadas per de dependéncias mancadas. Aquò rai, son sonque "
"d’errors."

#: dselect/install:105
msgid ""
"above this message are important. Please fix them and run [I]nstall again"
msgstr ""
"çò al dessús d’aqueste messatge es important.\r\n"
"Volgatz corregir e relançar l’[i]nstallacion."

#: dselect/update:30
msgid "Merging available information"
msgstr "Fusion de las informacions disponiblas"
